    text 🔬This is a nightly-only experimental API. (test)
    row
      text Expand description
      col
        text Support code for rustc’s built in unit-test and micro-benchmarking framework.
        text Almost all user code will only be interested in Bencher and black_box. All other interactions (such as writing tests and benchmarks themselves) should be done via the #[test] and #[bench] attributes.
        text See the  of the book for more details.
        link "Testing Chapter" ../book/ch11-00-testing.html
